      "textRaw": "HttpResponseBody",
      "name": "httpresponsebody",
      "desc": "<p>HttpResponseBody 是 <code>http</code> 模块响应对象的 <code>body</code> 字段类型.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>源码依据: <code>runtime/api/augment/http/ResponseBodyNativeObject.kt</code>, <code>HttpSaveResult.kt</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">HttpResponseBody</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
