        {
          "textRaw": "[m] saveToFile",
          "name": "[m]_savetofile",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "saveToFile(path, bufferSize?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "saveToFile",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 保存目标文件路径, 不可为目录</li>\n<li><strong>[ bufferSize = <code>8192</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 缓冲区大小</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#httpsaveresult\">HttpSaveResult</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将响应体直接保存到文件, 避免把大响应整体加载到内存.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let res = http.get(&#39;https://example.com/file.zip&#39;);\nlet saved = res.body.saveToFile(&#39;./file.zip&#39;);\nconsole.log(saved.success, saved.bytesCopied);\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "bufferSize?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] saveToFile"
        },
